<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Arch Comms upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Arch Comms upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it raised its recommendation on Arch Communications Group Inc to outperform from neutral.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 7/8 to 11-7/8.</p>
</text>
